"""gw2-touchbar-settings: put the GW2 Touch Bar together. Pages of panels, each with its own width, colour,
font size and style, a live preview of the real 2008x60 bar, and the general settings. Every change is
saved to ~/.config/gw2-touchbar/config.toml right away and the running bar picks it up within 2 s.
Text fields are saved while you type, the watchlist on Enter or when you leave it.

The app is also the bar's on/off switch. Nothing starts the bar at boot or when GW2 starts: switch it on here
and it takes the Touch Bar whenever GW2 runs, close the app and tiny-dfr's F-keys are back."""
